<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo says to announce earnings forecast change.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo says to announce earnings forecast change.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Corp said its president Kenji Miyahara will announce a revision in the company's earnings forecast at 3.30 p.m. (0630 GMT) on Thursday afternoon.</p>
</text>
